{
  "id": "30619_funayoi",
  "headword": "{船酔|ふなよ}い",
  "reading": "ふなよい",
  "romaji": "funayoi",
  "part_of_speech": "noun",
  "gloss": "seasickness",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "seasickness; getting sick on a boat",
      "explanation": "Nausea and dizziness brought on by the motion of a boat or ship. Takes する to form the verb {船酔|ふなよ}いする, and is the sea counterpart of {車酔|くるまよ}い (carsickness)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "30619_funayoi_ex1",
      "japanese": "{船酔|ふなよ}いしてしまった。",
      "english": "I got seasick.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30619_funayoi_ex2",
      "japanese": "{船酔|ふなよ}いしやすいので{酔|よ}い{止|ど}めを{飲|の}んだ。",
      "english": "I get seasick easily, so I took motion-sickness medicine.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30619_funayoi_ex3",
      "japanese": "{波|なみ}が{高|たか}く、{船酔|ふなよ}いで{甲板|かんぱん}に{出|で}られない{乗客|じょうきゃく}もいた。",
      "english": "The waves were high, and some passengers were too seasick to go out on deck.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {船酔|ふなよ}いする: to get seasick\n- {船酔|ふなよ}いしやすい: to be prone to seasickness\n- {船酔|ふなよ}い{止|ど}め: seasickness medicine\n- ひどい{船酔|ふなよ}い: bad seasickness\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {車酔|くるまよ}い: carsickness\n- {乗|の}り{物酔|ものよ}い: motion sickness in general, covering any vehicle",
